# Authors

The GOLI-CLI project is authored and maintained by the contributors listed
below. For an up-to-date list, see the Git history and the GitHub
contributors page.

## Lead Authors

- **GOLI-CLI Contributors** <contrib@goli-cli.dev>

## How to Be Added

This file is a flat, alphabetically-sorted list of human contributors. To add
yourself, submit a pull request modifying this file with the format:

```
- **Your Name** <your.email@example.com>
```

AI-generated code is not eligible for authorship credit. All AI-assisted
contributions must be reviewed, signed off, and authored by a human
contributor. See `docs/decisions/0008-ai-authorship-policy.md` for the
rationale (US Copyright Office guidance and *Thaler v. Perlmutter*).

## Corporate Sponsors

(None at present. To be listed here, contact contrib@goli-cli.dev.)
